{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a foundational multimodal approach combining RNA data encoded with pca_n2000 and image data encoded with resnet50, using concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest moderate performance, providing an initial baseline for multimodal integration. The effectiveness of the fusion strategy and encoder choices remains uncertain without direct comparison to single-modality baselines."
}

